    "Knob caps use 0 degrees straight up and clockwise-positive rotation.",
    "Swing defaults to the printed 0 position (-130 degrees); fine swing defaults to straight up.",
    "Discrete selector detents follow printed destinations and override the continuous range.",
    "Mode maps six printed destinations; instrument-select maps twelve; auto-fill maps six.",
    "Every LED has lens-only bounds and individual on/off state assets, with extra global margins for glow.",
    "The About hotspot uses the unchanged printed brand and has no separate artwork.",
    "The DAW stores plugin state and supplies the clock. START/STOP is a transport indicator and does not initiate playback."
